["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">症</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>症状；疾病</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">症状</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうじょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">症状；病情</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">症</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">病症；疾病；症状</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">暫</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>暂时；片刻；一会儿；长久</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ザン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しばら.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">忠</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>忠诚；忠实；信义</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">忠告</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちゅうこく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">劝告；忠告；警告</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">忠実</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちゅうじつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">忠实；忠诚；忠贞；诚实；真实</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">倉</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>仓库；储藏室；地窖；金库</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">くら</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">倉庫</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そうこ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">仓库；货栈；存储设施</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">彦</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>少年；男子（古代）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゲン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひこ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">肝</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>肝脏；胆量；关键</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">きも</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">肝心</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんじん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">至关重要；重要；关键；主要</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">喚</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>叫喊；呼叫；召唤；尖叫；哭喊</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">わめ.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">沿</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>沿；顺沿；沿着；沿袭；沿循</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">エン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">そ.う・-ぞ.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">沿岸</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えんがん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">海岸；岸边；沿岸水域；近海水域；沿岸地区</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">沿線</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えんせん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">沿线；铁路沿线；公路沿线</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">沿い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぞい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">沿着；沿；靠着（河流、海岸、铁路等）；在（街道等）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">妙</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>绝妙；奇妙；神秘；奇异；精巧</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ミョウ・ビョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たえ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">妙</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">みょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">奇怪；怪异；古怪；奇妙；奇迹；神奇；卓越；妙处；聪慧；灵巧；巧妙；技巧</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">奇妙</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きみょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">奇怪；奇异；怪异；奇特</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">微妙</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">びみょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">微妙；精妙；细微；复杂；棘手；微妙的处境；可疑；不确定；有疑问；一般；不怎么样；勉强；略微；有些；稍微</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">唱</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>唱歌；诵读；提倡</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">とな.える</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">合唱</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">がっしょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">齐唱；合唱；众人一起唱歌；合唱；合唱团演唱；集体演唱</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">唱える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">となえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">诵读；吟诵；呼喊；高喊；主张；倡导；宣扬</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">阿</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>非洲；奉承；角落；凹处</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ア・オ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おもね.る・くま</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">索</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>绳索；搜索；询问</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">索引</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さくいん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">索引；检索表</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">捜索</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そうさく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">搜索；搜寻；搜救；（依法对人或建筑物等的）搜查</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">模索</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もさく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">摸索；探索；寻找</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">誠</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>真诚；真实；忠诚</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">まこと</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">誠</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まこと</span><span class=\"k-wz\">真实；现实；事实；诚心；诚意；忠诚；善意；确实；真的；绝对；实在；非常；相当</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">誠実</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せいじつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">诚实；忠实；老实</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">襲</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>袭击；继承；重叠</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おそ.う・かさ.ね</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">襲う</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おそう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">袭击；进攻；突袭；打击；捕猎；继任；接任；承袭；突然造访；冷不防地访问</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">襲撃</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅうげき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（突然的）袭击；攻击；突袭；冲击</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">懇</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>恳切；殷勤；亲切；好客；诚挚</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ねんご.ろ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">俳</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>俳句；演员</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ハイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">俳優</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はいゆう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">演员；表演者</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">俳句</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はいく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">俳句；十七音诗（通常为三行，分别为五、七、五音）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">柄</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>图案；花纹；性质；体格；手柄</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヘイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">がら・え・つか</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">柄</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">え</span><span class=\"k-wz\">柄；握柄；把手；柄；茎；梗</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">間柄</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あいだがら</span><span class=\"k-wz\">关系；交情；往来</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">大柄</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おおがら</span><span class=\"k-wz\">身材高大；体格魁梧；大花纹；大图案</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">驚</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>惊讶；惊吓；惊恐；惊奇；惊动</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おどろ.く・おどろ.かす</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">驚く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おどろく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">惊讶；吃惊；惊奇；震惊；害怕；受惊；惊恐</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">驚かす</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おどろかす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">使惊吓